  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 694925d99107355428ee965f7b9638b1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Clover.Runtime::Clover.World.StoneCard
  ShowWithin: 1.1
  LineLength: 38
  Words: 'BLACK MOON (Dark, the ''orb'' form)

    A slow orb follows the nearest enemy and bursts on it. Strike the orb yourself and it bursts at once, larger.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Put it in a spell slot at a rest, then cast it with that slot ( + , , , ). 30 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
  thing: {fileID: 594841564}
  text: {fileID: 1409122498}
  back: {fileID: 812717852}
  shown: {fileID: 1442730938}
  lineHeight: 0.17
  letterWidth: 0.075
