  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Clover.Runtime::Clover.World.StoneCard
  ShowWithin: 1.1
  LineLength: 38
  Words: 'BRAND OF DAY (Light, the ''brand'' form)

    A sign is set on the enemy you face. Your next three weapon blows on it each set off a burst.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Put it in a spell slot at a rest, then cast it with that slot ( + , , , ). 25 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
