  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 694925d99107355428ee965f7b9638b1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Clover.Runtime::Clover.World.StoneCard
  ShowWithin: 1.1
  LineLength: 38
  Words: 'FALLING BLADES (Metal, the ''blades'' form)

    Blades appear over the enemy you face, hang a moment, then fall one after another.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Put it in a spell slot at a rest, then cast it with that slot ( + , , , ). 30 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
  thing: {fileID: 1764725532}
